        ],
        Brain: {
            memories: {}
        },
        CanPickUpLoot: 0b,
        CustomNameVisible: 1b,
        DialogData: {
            Type: "STANDARD",
            DialogDataSet: [
                {
                    Conditions: [
                        {
                            Type: "PLAYER_TAG",
                            Operation: "EQUALS",
                            Name: "traded_fuslie"
                        }
                    ],
                    Priority: 20,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Ask how the deal was struck",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "OPEN_NAMED_DIALOG",
                                    Cmd: "seal"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "seal_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "She is in good hands",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "leave_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "How is she settling in? Do not let the scarf fool you — she commits to exactly one idea at a time, and every so often that idea is just 'do not get hit,' which, honestly, relatable. She will carry you. She carried me through worse than a marsh."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "The hut is quieter now and I can hear myself think, which is its own kind of horror. Take her somewhere with a real current. She was never going to be happy in a puddle. Neither was I, but that is a different arc."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Fuslie — the ghost fish",
                    Label: "after"
                },
                {
                    Priority: 10,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Trade a Barboach for the Basculegion",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "cobblemon-initiative trade barboach basculegion 28 traded_fuslie held_item=cobblemon:choice_scarf moves=waterfall,aquajet,aquatail,protect"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Conditions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "PLAYER_TAG",
                                    Operation: "EQUALS",
                                    Name: "no_traded_fuslie"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "trade_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "Not parting with a fish today",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "decline_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "Oh thank god, a face. I have been out here 'communing with the wetlands' for weeks and the wetlands do not clap. You want to see something genuinely cool? Come here. Look at the water."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "That is a Basculegion. My Basculegion. She swam upstream until it killed her, and then she just — kept swimming. A whole school of stubborn wearing one fish like a coat. I love her, but she is a lot, and this hut is small. Bring me a Barboach — any mud-whiskered one out of the pools — and she is yours. Straight across, no coin. Coin gets counted, and I am trying very hard to stay off a certain ledger."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Now — the tech. Brand new, cutting edge, one hundred percent intentional: she holds a Choice Scarf AND she runs Protect. On the same fish. On purpose. Do not give me that look. You lock into Protect, you outspeed the entire lobby, and then you simply do not get hit. It is called innovation. I have been cooking this in the lab for weeks."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Has it won a single game? That is not the metric we are tracking. The metric is: is it tech. And it is tech. Take the fish, run the set exactly as built, and tell absolutely no one it was an accident, because it was not."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Fuslie — the west-edge hermit bit",
                    Label: "default"
                },
                {
                    Priority: -1,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Good luck out here",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "leave_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "Struck — no coin, no counter, no clip. Keep her fed and keep her moving and she will keep you standing. That is not marsh wisdom, that is just what works. Now shoo, I have wetlands to not-vlog."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Fuslie — struck",
                    Label: "seal"
                }
            ]
        },
